  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#windowproxy-getprototypeof\n\n> 7.4.1 [[GetPrototypeOf]] ( )\n\nBecause the HTML specification defines custom [[GetPrototypeOf]] internal methods for WindowProxy and Location, it allows for cycles in Window / Location prototype chain.\n\nThis is because of https://tc39.github.io/ecma262/#sec-ordinarysetprototypeof (step 8.c.i).\n\nIs this really something we want to allow? This makes implementing the HTML specification difficult, at least in WebKit.\n\nhttps://github.com/tc39/ecma262/issues/683 tracks the issue for EcmaScript.\n",
